index 0000000..a72c081
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7220.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed the displayed paths of traceback entries when a test or fixture changes
+the current working directory: paths are now shown relative to the directory
+pytest was invoked from instead of the (possibly changed) current working
+directory.
